====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{label|en|obsolete|intransitive|hunting}} To release a new set of [[hound]]s. {{defdate|15th-17th c.}}
# {{label|en|transitive|now|_|rare}} To [[place]] (people or horses) in relays, such that one can take over form another. {{defdate|from 18th c.}}
# {{label|en|intransitive|now|_|rare}} To take on a new relay of [[horse]]s; to change horses. {{defdate|from 19th c.}}
# {{label|en|transitive}} To [[pass on]] or [[transfer]] (information). {{defdate|from 19th c.}}

